"Officially tested by the Mesa team. The safest and most reliable choice for "
"everyday use, gaming, and video playback."
msgstr ""
"Službeno testirano od strane Mesa tima. Najsigurniji i najpouzdaniji izbor "
"za svakodnevnu upotrebu, igre i reprodukciju videa."

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:284
